 R←Test_API_180(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;buff;types
⍝ Checks whether all APLGit2 user commands have an API equivalent
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 buff←⎕SE.UCMD'APLGit2* -?'
 buff←APLTreeUtils2.DLB ¯4↓2↓(⎕UCS 13)(≠⊆⊢)buff
 buff←↑{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳' '}¨buff
 buff←((' '~⍨¨↓buff)≢¨⊂'CloneRepo')⌿buff   ⍝ Those have not API call
 types←⊃∘##.APLGit2.API.⎕NC¨↓buff
 →T.PassesIf 3∧.=types

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
